OL,3,GNEWSARail disruption due to overhead
OL,4,Aline fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FRail passengers are being urged to
OL,7,Fcheck before they travel due to
OL,8,Foverhead line problems on the West
OL,9,FCoast Main Line in Staffordshire.
OL,11,FWork was ongoing to fix a fault with
OL,12,Fthe 25,000-volt wires which power
OL,13,Ftrains near Penkridge, causing
OL,14,Fdisruption between Stafford and
OL,15,FWolverhampton.
OL,17,FAt 12:00 BST, National Rail confirmed
OL,18,Fthat lines have reopened between
OL,19,FStafford and Birmingham New Street, but
OL,20,Fresidual disruption can still be
OL,21,Fexpected until 16:00 BST on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
