OL,3,GNEWSARail disruption due to overhead
OL,4,Aline fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdam Checkley from Network Rail, said:
OL,7,F"Our teams have now cleared the issue
OL,8,Fallowing the route to reopen, but with
OL,9,Ftrains and their crew out of position,
OL,10,Fdelays and cancellations will continue
OL,11,Fthroughout the day."
